# {{ site.longName }}

> Unofficial, free, ad-free guide to Grand Theft Auto VI (GTA 6): a step-by-step story walkthrough, a 100% completion route in play order, every trophy with a method, collectible tick lists by county, and reference guides. Spoiler-safe: story details sit in closed blocks and each mission page covers only that mission.

How to read the status labels: **Confirmed** = from Rockstar or the platform trophy list. **Reported** = from a trusted guide source, or two independent sources that agree. **Verified** = checked in our own game. Pages not yet checked in-game say "First pass". Leaks and datamined content are not used. Each page shows the date it was last updated.

